{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3474853df4f10859","name":"K'tara Training","source":{"id":"source:reference-3474853df4f10859","title":"K'tara Training","revision":20886,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:43:04Z","sha256":"869c49e2b920dd1946b88dc057e82f78446cd2ae70ae24ee73bc8da6c6ada71e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20886","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=K%27tara%20Training&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3474853df4f10859","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in the K'tara style of unarmed fighting, which enables you to neutralize enemies before they even know that you are present.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You roll an extra die of damage against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," enemy on one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," during your turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when you deal damage with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," to a target that has been denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", make a second ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," against the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". If successful, you render the target incapable of speech until the end of your next turn. This is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stunning"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stunning"}," effect.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["K'tara Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/K%27tara_Expertise"}]}," Talent, you can spend two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to cause a single adjacent enemy to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against your first attack during the same round.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
